other Brazilian team of " [:a {:href "/athletes/51776"} "Sandra"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/51902"} "Adriana Samuel"] " quite easily. Facing Adriana Behar and Shelda in the final, they were behind early, but came back to win the first set, 12-11. The second set was similar, as the Brazilians jumped to an early lead, but the Australians could not be denied, winning in straights, 12-11 and 12-10. Adriana and Shelda would return to again win the World Championships in 2001."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button22355", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button22355').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Matches Played"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Wins"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Losses"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Sets"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Faults"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Aces"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Fastest Serve"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Attack Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Attack Successes"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Block Successes"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Dig Successes"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "Australia 1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AUS.png"}] "AUS"]] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "5"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "5"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "0"] [